  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这些孩子是\n垃圾袋宝可梦破破袋。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E9B5B695B50662F000A5783573E888B5B9D53EF68A678347834888B3002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它们好像喜欢上了\n我们咖啡馆的厨余垃圾，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n于是就开始聚集在店里了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834EEC597D50CF559C6B224E0A4E86000A62114EEC549655619986768453A84F595783573EFF0C00100001BE00000A4E8E662F5C315F0059CB805A96C657285E9791CC4E8620262026001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破哒～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "783454D2FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我很高兴破破袋们\n也喜欢我们店的东西。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但是因为也有人不喜欢\n破破袋的气味，所以客人变少了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F889AD8517478347834888B4EEC000A4E5F559C6B2262114EEC5E9776844E1C897F300200100001BE01000A4F46662F56E04E3A4E5F67094EBA4E0D559C6B22000A78347834888B76846C145473FF0C62404EE55BA24EBA53D85C114E8620262026001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然它们是喜欢我们的厨余垃圾，\n那就好好利用这一点吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E271365B834EEC662F559C6B2262114EEC768453A84F595783573EFF0C000A90A35C31597D597D522975288FD94E0070B95427FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意帮忙用我们的厨余垃圾……\n也就是用美味垃圾<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n把破破袋们引到垃圾场吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F5E2E5FD9752862114EEC768453A84F595783573E20262026000A4E5F5C31662F75287F8E54735783573E00100001BE00000A628A78347834888B4EEC5F1552305783573E573A5417FF1F001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是准备好了，就拜托你咯！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F51C65907597D4E86FF0C5C3162DC62584F6054AFFF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里今天是对战特区啊……\n破破袋的事就拜托你明天帮忙了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CC4ECA5929662F5BF962187279533A554A20262026000A78347834888B76844E8B5C3162DC62584F60660E59295E2E5FD94E86FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想拜托你帮忙\n把破破袋引到垃圾场去。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你准备好了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F362DC62584F605E2E5FD9000A628A78347834888B5F1552305783573E573A53BB300200100001BE00000A4F6051C65907597D4E865417FF1F001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没问题！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA195EE9898FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉～\n我忙得抽不开身呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5509FF5E000A62115FD95F9762BD4E0D5F008EAB54403002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你，真是帮大忙了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F60FF0C771F662F5E2E59275FD94E86FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要你带着这个，\n破破袋应该就会跟着你去垃圾场了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89814F605E2677408FD94E2AFF0C000A78347834888B5E948BE55C314F1A8DDF77404F6053BB5783573E573A4E863002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "记得走慢一点，\n不然破破袋们会跟丢的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BB05F978D7061624E0070B9FF0C000A4E0D713678347834888B4EEC4F1A8DDF4E227684FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "垃圾场沿着这条路直走就到！\n拜托你了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5783573E573A6CBF77408FD967618DEF76F48D705C315230FF01000A62DC62584F604E86FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你沿着这条路直走，\n把美味垃圾放在路的尽头处吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F606CBF77408FD967618DEF76F48D70FF0C000A628A7F8E54735783573E653E57288DEF76845C3D5934590454273002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沿着这条路直走，\n把破破袋引向路的尽头处吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CBF77408FD967618DEF76F48D70FF0C000A628A78347834888B5F1554118DEF76845C3D593459045427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要把美味垃圾\n放在垃圾场吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981628A7F8E54735783573E000A653E57285783573E573A5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "放",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "653E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 2
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不放",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D653E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破破哒～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7834783454D2FF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破破袋们陶醉地\n吃着美味垃圾……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78347834888B4EEC967691895730000A540377407F8E54735783573E202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你帮我搬运垃圾！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F605E2E6211642C8FD05783573EFF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "离这么远的话，破破袋们的气味\n就不会飘到咖啡馆了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "79BB8FD94E488FDC76848BDDFF0C78347834888B4EEC76846C145473000A5C314E0D4F1A98D852305496556199864E863002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破破袋们吃得好欢啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78347834888B4EEC54035F97597D6B22554A3002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我稍微思考了一下……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n原来和宝可梦共同生活，\n并不只是让它们待在身边啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117A0D5FAE601D80034E864E004E0B2026202600100001BE01000A539F6765548C5B9D53EF68A65171540C751F6D3BFF0C000A5E764E0D53EA662F8BA95B834EEC5F8557288EAB8FB9554A3002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破破袋喜欢咖啡馆的饭，\n但我又不能让它们在店里吃。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78347834888B559C6B225496556199867684996DFF0C000A4F46621153C84E0D80FD8BA95B834EEC57285E9791CC54033002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "像这样找出恰到好处的距离，\n也是和宝可梦共生的一种方式吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50CF8FD96837627E51FA60705230597D590476848DDD79BBFF0C000A4E5F662F548C5B9D53EF68A65171751F76844E0079CD65B95F0F54273002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦跟在身后走……\n光是这样就好可爱啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A68DDF57288EAB540E8D7020262026000A5149662F8FD968375C31597D53EF7231554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？\n这个气味有点浓烈呀……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F000A8FD94E2A6C145473670970B96D5370C85440202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "感觉像是列阵兵一样，\n看起来好辛苦，加油啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "611F89C950CF662F5217963551754E006837FF0C000A770B8D776765597D8F9B82E6FF0C52A06CB9554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破破袋这种宝可梦，\n是会帮忙吃垃圾的对吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78347834888B8FD979CD5B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A662F4F1A5E2E5FD954035783573E76845BF95427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你和破破袋们这场\n小小的旅行顺利结束了呀。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F60548C78347834888B4EEC8FD9573A000A5C0F5C0F768465C5884C987A52297ED3675F4E86544030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    }
  ],
